      "id": "lv-likumi-ai-centre",
      "title": "Mākslīgā intelekta centra likums (Artificial Intelligence Centre Law)",
      "title_en": "Artificial Intelligence Centre Law",
      "url": "https://m.likumi.lv/ta/id/359339",
      "archive_url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20261017012425/https://m.likumi.lv/ta/id/359339",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "Centrs sadarbībā ar kompetentajām institūcijām organizē speciālo regulatīvo vidi, kurā var darboties no spēkā esošiem normatīvajiem aktiem atšķirīgi noteikumi, lai nodrošinātu mākslīgā intelekta sistēmu izstrādi, pārbaudi un attīstību.",
          "gloss": "The centre, in cooperation with the competent institutions, organises a special regulatory environment in which rules different from those of the regulations in force may apply, in order to ensure the development, testing and improvement of artificial intelligence systems.",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "text": "nodibinājuma \"Mākslīgā intelekta centrs\" (turpmāk — centrs)",
              "kind": "definition",
              "gloss": "the foundation \"Artificial Intelligence Centre\" (the centre)"
            }
          ],
          "accessed": "2026-10-17",
          "reread": {
            "state": "confirmed",
            "last_found": "2026-11-16",
            "since": null
          },
          "supports": [
            "/record/claims/0/text"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "veicināt mākslīgā intelekta tehnoloģiju pielietojumu publiskajā un privātajā sektorā",
          "gloss": "promote the application of artificial intelligence technologies in the public and private sectors",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "text": "4. pants. Centra uzdevumi (1) Centram ir šādi uzdevumi:",
              "kind": "heading",
              "gloss": "Section 4. Tasks of the centre (1) The centre has the following tasks:"
            },
